# Notes

In this code we are...
1) combining sequencing analysis across multiple sequencing runs
2) removing chimmeras
3) clustering asv into otu
4) aligning asv and otu tables to SILVA taxonomy
5) producing finished asv and otu tables with SILVA taxonomy information

